            {
                "entry_id": "56258408-df7a-3400-9769-6082c43dbf71",
                "word": "complication",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "d245ea8f-991b-429d-9c4f-51088902525b",
                        "entry_id": "56258408-df7a-3400-9769-6082c43dbf71",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "complications"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a12cc290-ba0c-3662-aaee-3c2b858b3dee",
                        "entry_id": "56258408-df7a-3400-9769-6082c43dbf71",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Assemblage, concours d’éléments, de circonstances ou d’incidents multiples susceptibles de créer des embarras, ou d’augmenter la difficulté ou le danger."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a4acf07f-66ba-448e-9533-18dfa90fbae7",
                                "sense_id": "a12cc290-ba0c-3662-aaee-3c2b858b3dee",
                                "text": "Ce coin perdu de Jan-Mayen n’est pas à l’abri des cancans, des mystères, des intrigues et même des complications diplomatiques."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "87d05aa8-7b28-442d-9bc4-cc944e67d69e",
                                "sense_id": "a12cc290-ba0c-3662-aaee-3c2b858b3dee",
                                "text": "Jolie somme ! Mais restait à la toucher… Or, ici, commence un procès aux complications inénarrables, et qui dura dix ans."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "76bb9288-5ceb-46eb-abc0-4d35974b1683",
                                "sense_id": "a12cc290-ba0c-3662-aaee-3c2b858b3dee",
                                "text": "Bien que souffrant d'une néphrite chronique avec complications cardiaques, il ne voulut pas consentir à prendre le moindre repos, […]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "717b16d1-63cc-4801-9b9e-4998e729106f",
                                "sense_id": "a12cc290-ba0c-3662-aaee-3c2b858b3dee",
                                "text": "Nous considérons en effet que contraindre les clients à aller payer leur péage dans des bureaux de tabac dans un délai court après leur voyage constitue une vraie régression et une forte complication en matière d’expérience client"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "03f58f89-d6e1-3b41-9a22-20d2c7a526f8",
                        "entry_id": "56258408-df7a-3400-9769-6082c43dbf71",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Propension à considérer les événements, les êtres ou les choses, plus complexes qu’ils le sont."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly",
                            "pejorative"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "914fe24a-baa2-4a71-8f98-a6a47ddb902c",
                                "sense_id": "03f58f89-d6e1-3b41-9a22-20d2c7a526f8",
                                "text": "L’abstraction devient la puissance de réflexion, l’inaction une capacité à formuler les problèmes, l’inadaptation une polyvalence, l’indécision la certitude de l'incertain, la rhétorique un agir communicationnel, la complication la conscience de la complexité et l’achiffrisme s'évanouit dans l'usage commune d'une règle de trois appliquée à une langue des affaires qu'on apprend comme n'importe quelle langue."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "698091c0-58c6-3e0a-aed2-123717d6d240",
                        "entry_id": "56258408-df7a-3400-9769-6082c43dbf71",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Fonctions supplémentaires ajoutées au mécanisme de base comme par exemple le tourbillon ou le quantième perpétuel."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Horlogerie"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4012a33c-5f10-4bc4-a944-7e60ffe54e1b",
                                "sense_id": "698091c0-58c6-3e0a-aed2-123717d6d240",
                                "text": "Cette montre est à la fois un bijou et une merveille de technologie : une complication affiche le cycle lunaire."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cd8be227-f825-4738-b980-f364ecda69e6",
                                "sense_id": "698091c0-58c6-3e0a-aed2-123717d6d240",
                                "text": "Sortie pour commémorer les 175 ans de la maison [Patek], la Grandmaster Chime réunit pour la première fois sur une montre-bracelet vingt complications."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d3554a79-ac1a-364d-bbbc-853192aa66ce",
                        "entry_id": "56258408-df7a-3400-9769-6082c43dbf71",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Montre ou garde-temps comportant une ou plusieurs complications."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "metonymically"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "74ee5448-1806-4627-b3f9-89bc794acdc4",
                        "source_entry_id": "56258408-df7a-3400-9769-6082c43dbf71",
                        "source_sense_id": "a12cc290-ba0c-3662-aaee-3c2b858b3dee",
                        "source_sense_description": "Assemblage, concours d’éléments, de circonstances ou d’incidents multiples susceptibles de créer des embarras, ou d’augmenter la difficulté ou le danger.",
                        "target_lang_word": "Komplikation",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Komplikation",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4e202296-a036-362c-b2a9-2b72ff518f4c",
                                        "entry_id": "39fdad81-1396-3a69-9c41-8f938ea3ee6c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "etwas, das ein Vorhaben schwieriger macht als geplant"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ef97e362-7b8e-48ed-870d-039dd3c8cd71",
                                                "sense_id": "4e202296-a036-362c-b2a9-2b72ff518f4c",
                                                "text": "Bei der Herzoperation kam es zu Komplikationen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5d40ca10-f7a7-4e09-a818-ebf5746295cf",
                                                "sense_id": "4e202296-a036-362c-b2a9-2b72ff518f4c",
                                                "text": "„Eine 59 Jahre alte Frau starb an der Komplikation.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "221dfc79-1939-4d6f-8aca-360d05917410",
                                                "sense_id": "4e202296-a036-362c-b2a9-2b72ff518f4c",
                                                "text": "Wenn man eine Bank überfallen will, ist ein zusätzlicher Wachmann eine zusätzliche Komplikation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0e6c492e-ccaf-4742-b42e-f3079cd35bd0",
                                                "sense_id": "4e202296-a036-362c-b2a9-2b72ff518f4c",
                                                "text": "„Liszt aber konnte und wollte keine Komplikationen erkennen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "651fead0-2a40-482a-9db6-2d9eb0896f75",
                                                "sense_id": "4e202296-a036-362c-b2a9-2b72ff518f4c",
                                                "text": "„Wie bei jedem Eingriff in den Körper kann es auch bei der Einnahme der Abtreibungspille zu Komplikationen kommen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cdbf2f8d-fadb-3e4f-ae69-d0e539b3c222",
                                        "entry_id": "39fdad81-1396-3a69-9c41-8f938ea3ee6c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Funktion eines mechanischen Uhrwerks, die über die Anzeige von Stunden, Minuten und Sekunden hinausgeht"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Uhrmacherei"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e8c0131b-a9c5-4f45-956c-7ff37bc3643a",
                                                "sense_id": "cdbf2f8d-fadb-3e4f-ae69-d0e539b3c222",
                                                "text": "Je nach Komplikation und Hersteller, kann sich der Preis einer guten Armbanduhr leicht vervielfachen."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1178cf11-64e1-4883-9474-d3fffe575b97",
                        "source_entry_id": "56258408-df7a-3400-9769-6082c43dbf71",
                        "source_sense_id": "a12cc290-ba0c-3662-aaee-3c2b858b3dee",
                        "source_sense_description": "Assemblage, concours d’éléments, de circonstances ou d’incidents multiples susceptibles de créer des embarras, ou d’augmenter la difficulté ou le danger.",
                        "target_lang_word": "setback",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "setback",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ee3b6616-56d9-3a30-b209-9e7201804d11",
                                        "entry_id": "1c3b0e65-497d-3c3b-9045-4b53f8d2bdc3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An obstacle, delay, disadvantage, or blow (an adverse event which slows down, or prevents progress towards a desired outcome)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5c1320dd-505f-4766-8c7c-e74505066fde",
                                                "sense_id": "ee3b6616-56d9-3a30-b209-9e7201804d11",
                                                "text": "After some initial setbacks, the expedition went safely on its way."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cbca7d98-84dc-4441-8426-595d032b902c",
                                                "sense_id": "ee3b6616-56d9-3a30-b209-9e7201804d11",
                                                "text": "DUKAT: I blame no one but myself. I was indiscreet. I compromised myself and have been punished accordingly. If someone under my command had behaved so outrageously, I would do the same thing to him. Besides, I assure you, this is only a temporary setback. Everything I have lost, I will regain. It's only a matter of time."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5d1613d7-6d1f-42a3-8e5d-3e58c5d1ba1c",
                                                "sense_id": "ee3b6616-56d9-3a30-b209-9e7201804d11",
                                                "text": "The Constitutional Court has ruled today, November 17th, that Section 1448 of the Thai Civil and Commercial, stating that “a marriage can take place only between a man and a woman”, is constitutional under the Thai constitutional law. This decision could be a major setback for many Thai LGBTQ activist groups’ continued journey of what they call basic human rights to legally allow same-sex marriages in Thailand."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8286dc9f-aaea-339f-979d-d151f6e45a06",
                                        "entry_id": "1c3b0e65-497d-3c3b-9045-4b53f8d2bdc3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any adverse event, defeat, or impediment of progress."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b873526f-4c6f-37ad-94f8-6da9df810b3f",
                                        "entry_id": "1c3b0e65-497d-3c3b-9045-4b53f8d2bdc3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The required distance between a structure and a road."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "23b78388-e8de-3b4f-b18a-e69ff4021c95",
                                        "entry_id": "1c3b0e65-497d-3c3b-9045-4b53f8d2bdc3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A step-like recession in a wall."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec1b5262-b0a6-43c5-9a65-9e016f80db1f",
                                                "sense_id": "23b78388-e8de-3b4f-b18a-e69ff4021c95",
                                                "text": "Setbacks were initially used for structural reasons, but now are often mandated by land use codes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6d9fbbe6-3624-31f1-b0fd-9df5e38de1b4",
                                        "entry_id": "1c3b0e65-497d-3c3b-9045-4b53f8d2bdc3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An offset to the temperature setting of a thermostat to cover a period when more or less heating is required than usual."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c11b7d21-2a33-43db-a6e7-c9a0242dbf64",
                                                "sense_id": "6d9fbbe6-3624-31f1-b0fd-9df5e38de1b4",
                                                "text": "Fuel savings from thermostat setbacks have long been accepted as fact, but little documentation existed to support it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7433905d-e377-3592-8ce0-53cc4c11683a",
                                        "entry_id": "1c3b0e65-497d-3c3b-9045-4b53f8d2bdc3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A backset; a countercurrent; an eddy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic",
                                            "possibly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9f97b26a-83b5-3f33-97f8-b40fba5806cd",
                                        "entry_id": "1c3b0e65-497d-3c3b-9045-4b53f8d2bdc3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A backset; a check; a repulse; a relapse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
